y.\n\nEdit:\n\nThis game gets pretty repetitive. Needs a lot more variety in everything.\nI feel like half the weapons are trash if you want to go for crits.\n\nNot a big fan of the ability change.\n\nAlso, something with the update makes my mouse feel lagged out.", "timestamp_created": 1605277327, "timestamp_updated": 1607022560, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519018471240997314", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79141073", "author": {"steamid": "76561198127367532", "personaname": "Bungis Gumbis", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BigBungisGumbis/", "num_games_owned": 365, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 6693, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 261, "last_played": 1747290794, "avatar": "fda07843eb386ed74134198fec0da0e98dd8b6bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a hidden gem. I personally love fps games with cool movement options and I love rogue lites. This game is a combo of both and its the best possible outcome of such a combo. Good fun and worth the price of admission.", "timestamp_created": 1605172870, "timestamp_updated": 1605173112, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}